{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# 📚 Prior research corpus — `platform_research_sessions/`\n\n~12 standalone Claude sessions, mapped and queued for piece-by-piece ingest (**Ingest track = TASK-2**, separate from the wayfinder decision map). Each node → the wayfinder ticket it informs + its ingest task. 🔄 = shape-extraction subagent running (parsing the `.jsonl` for arc + decisions + **missteps**). Companion: `canvas/wayfinder-map.canvas`.","x":-700,"y":-420,"width":1400,"height":150,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"h_found","type":"text","text":"## 🏛️ Foundation","x":-1080,"y":-180,"width":300,"height":70,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"s_scoping","type":"text","text":"### Program scoping workspace\n**Three-layer thesis:** platform wedge → AI practice → insurance grand prize. Hypothesis/decision registers, AU framing (CPS 234, SOCI).\n→ informs the **whole map** + business-model fog\n⏳ ingest `TASK-2.1` (curated md)","x":-1080,"y":-90,"width":300,"height":315,"color":"6"},
