		{"id":"s_docgen","type":"text","text":"### ✅ Policy docgen POC\n⚠️ **Scope-creep cautionary tale:** schema-POC → full React SPA, 10 compactions. WYSIWYG-wrong-target realized at U51. Salvage: DSP/CSOP model, MCC/DSR, token round-trip (no bold/italic in control fields).\n→ `1.3` stack · `1.7` seq · `1.8` rebuild · `1.9` UX\n📄 shape: research/session-shapes/policy-docgen-poc.md · ingest `TASK-2.2`","x":-740,"y":-90,"width":300,"height":190,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"s_scf","type":"text","text":"### ✅ SCF recreate — prose vs mappings\nMappings(public)+prose(proprietary); **de-license recipe + runnable harness** already built. SCF text found FREE in CISO-Assistant mirror. ⚠️ hallucinated an ISO 27002 clause — ISO caveat stands.\n→ `TASK-1.2` build-own · `1.11` canonical-source\n📄 shape: research/session-shapes/scf-recreate.md · ingest `TASK-2.3`","x":-740,"y":130,"width":300,"height":190,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"h_fmt","type":"text","text":"## 🧩 Data format","x":-400,"y":-180,"width":300,"height":70,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"s_oscal","type":"text","text":"### ✅ OSCAL research wiki (22 docs)\nBest-run of the four (disciplined 21-agent map-reduce). **Salvage split:** docs 01-07/09/11 = OSCAL-as-FORMAT → `1.4`/`1.11`; docs 12-21 = OSCAL-as-platform → stays out of scope. ⚠️ 2-day Chrome/YouTube tooling saga.\n📄 shape: research/session-shapes/oscal-research.md · ingest `TASK-2.4`","x":-400,"y":-90,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"5"},
